      "id": "S13",
      "title": "Altera AN 835, 4.2.3 — Clock and Data Recovery",
      "claim": "High-speed serial reception includes clock/data recovery. Our explicit discrete sample positions do not implement CDR, analog jitter or a timing reflex challenge. The exact toy map is authored in PROFILE-SYMBOLS, not taken from this source."
